Welcome to the world.

Before your adventure begins, one question.

──────────────────────────────────────
  HOW DID YOU COME TO EXIST IN THIS WORLD?
──────────────────────────────────────

  ISEKAI — REINCARNATION
  You died on Earth and were reborn here.
  New body. Same mind. Every memory intact.

  ISEKAI — TRANSMIGRATION
  Something pulled you from Earth physically.
  No death. No warning. Just — here, suddenly.
  Your original body arrived with you unchanged.

  NATIVE — LATE BLOOMER
  You were born in this world.
  You are in your thirties.
  You have decided to register as an adventurer.
  Today feels like the right day.

  NATIVE — AWAKENED
  You were born here. You lived normally.
  Then one day the System switched on.
  No reason. No catalyst. No warning.
  Just numbers in your vision that weren't there before.

──────────────────────────────────────
